AMORCE - 3 steps to a self-running box
=======================================

1) INSTALL (from adb shell, as root):
     sh /mnt/media_rw/*/INSTALLER.sh
   -> installs tools, boot hook, applies configs, starts the web panel

2) CHECK:
     browser: http://<ip-box>:8000/          (6 pages, green port badges)
     nreg                                     (10-theme non-regression)

3) REBOOT:
     wait 4-6 min -> panel comes back ALONE.
     Everything (memory profile, network, clock, web stack) restarts by itself.

Full procedure : docs/STARTUP.md
Panel guide    : docs/IHM.md
